# Moddy Arena: a whole battle, won. The player presses the start button in the prep room the Minecraft way, five waves
# come one after another (the default table in the arena's rules file), each is cleared, the battle is won, and the
# arena is put back as built: no mobs, no drops, and a wall of planks put in it during the battle gone.
# The mobs are killed by command (this proves the battle loop, not the player's sword); the player is kept safe.
@intent a player presses the start button, clears five waves, wins, and the arena is tidied afterwards
@world flat seed=1

@step arrive
@expect chat Welcome to Moddy Arena within 90s
@wait 2s
# a fresh world's difficulty may be anything but Peaceful's; make sure (each command must change something)
difficulty hard
difficulty normal
effect give @s minecraft:resistance 600 4 true
effect give @s minecraft:saturation 600 0 true

@step he presses the start button
# beside the gate, on the prep room's side of the shared wall, at chest height
tp @s 1.5 64 19.5 180 0
@wait 1s
@aim pos 2.5 65.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect chat A battle is starting within 5s
@expect bossbar Wave 1 of 5 within 5s
@shot countdown

@step wave 1 comes
@expect title Wave 1 of 5 within 15s
@assert execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
# into the arena through the gate's place, looking north over the floor at the mobs
tp @s 0 64 12 180 10
@wait 2s
@expect bossbar /Wave 1 of 5: [0-9]+ monsters? left/ within 5s
@shot wave-1-in-the-arena
# something put in the arena during the battle, as a wish would: the reset clears it
fill -3 64 -8 3 66 -8 minecraft:oak_planks
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 1 cleared within 5s

@step waves 2 to 4
@expect title Wave 2 of 5 within 20s
@wait 1s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 2 cleared within 5s
@expect title Wave 3 of 5 within 20s
@wait 1s
@shot wave-3
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 3 cleared within 5s
@expect title Wave 4 of 5 within 20s
@wait 1s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 4 cleared within 5s

@step the last wave, and the win
@expect title Wave 5 of 5 within 20s
@wait 2s
@shot wave-5
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title You won within 5s
@expect chat You won the battle within 5s
@shot won

@step the arena is tidied
@expect chat The arena is tidy again within 15s
@wait 1s
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=!minecraft:player,x=-17,y=60,z=-17,dx=34,dy=40,dz=34]
# the arena's inside is empty air again (compared with the empty sky at y 200), the planks gone
@assert execute if blocks -15 64 -15 15 67 15 -15 200 -15 all
@assert execute if block 0 63 0 minecraft:smooth_sandstone
@assert execute if block -16 65 0 minecraft:stone_bricks
@expect bossbar Wave gone within 5s
@aim look 180 15
@wait 1s
@shot the-arena-tidy
